WEBVTT

00:03:29.455 --> 00:03:31.791
just like a thigh muscle does.

00:03:35.002 --> 00:03:36.629
Let me tell you how this works.

00:03:38.339 --> 00:03:42.301
So we take laminated sheets

00:03:42.343 --> 00:03:44.762
to create pouches.

00:03:44.762 --> 00:03:47.723
We have several of these pouches
within a single muscle.

00:03:48.182 --> 00:03:49.809
We now take a conductive ink

00:03:49.850 --> 00:03:53.187
and spray-coat that ink
onto these pouches,

00:03:53.229 --> 00:03:55.439
and then we inject them with oil.

00:03:58.401 --> 00:03:59.694
After having done this,

00:03:59.694 --> 00:04:03.948
we have a conductive ink that acts
like a flexible electrode